      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "Same Weight, No Dominant Spoke",
      "items": [
        "Two Builders, a Shaper, a QA walk, and a Rin gate can run at the same moment",
        "No single spoke dominates — several agents, same moment, no collision",
        "Each spoke's branch and worktree are its own, never shared"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "rose",
      "title": "Cleanup Is Thomas's",
      "items": [
        "A Builder commits, pushes, then returns to Thomas",
        "Thomas verifies the diff and decides the merge",
        "Cleanup of a worktree, branch, and pane is his, not the Builder's"
      ]
